From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Scope S22-only final workarounds and recognize Rubin38

Reason: final-tail78b.txt:346,350-351 finds changed DressRoom object-capture,
IPService VizManager and Rubin38 layout. Prior runtime evidence belongs to S22,
not AZH4: do not transplant its classifier-disable or derived database-password
workarounds onto unrelated donor classes. Keep A376B implementations/encryption
and require runtime logs before adapting these fixes. The package-presence gate
must check actual RubinVersion38 instead of RubinVersion37 on this donor.
Files: unica/patches/exynos9810_device_stack/exynos9810_finalization/customize.sh.
Verification: exact source guards, actual package paths inspected, diagnostic
helpers/package gate, shell/replay and clean build. Optional wallpaper/classifier/
personalization behavior remains unverified on M2; no runtime success claim.

---
